BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 656.0 Tm (The sequence A202137 consists of positive integers k for which 24k+1 is neither prime nor a perfect) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 643.5 Tm (square. We prove that it contains infinitely many runs of every prescribed finite length. The proof) Tj ET
